@startuml MiniPay - 3DS2 Authentication Sequence
!theme blueprint
title MiniPay — Secventa: 3DS2 Challenge Flow

skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 2
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #EBF5FB
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #2980B9
skinparam noteBorderColor #F39C12
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FEF9E7

actor "Cardholder" as CH
actor "Merchant\nFrontend" as M
participant "gateway-svc\n:8084" as GW #E8F4FD
participant "fraud-svc\n:8090" as FRD #FDEDEC
participant "tds-svc\n:8088\n(ACS)" as TDS #E8F4FD
database "PostgreSQL\ntds_challenges" as PG #FEF9E7
participant "network-svc\n:8086" as NET #E8F4FD
participant "issuer-svc\n:8087" as ISS #E8F4FD

== Detectare risc mediu ==

M -> GW : POST /v1/payments/authorize\n{ pan, amount: 75000 RON }
activate GW
GW -> FRD : score(dpan, amount=75000)
activate FRD
FRD --> GW : { score: 0.63, decision: "CHALLENGE" }
deactivate FRD
note right of FRD : 0.5 ≤ score < 0.8\n→ 3DS2 necesar

GW --> M : 200 { status: "CHALLENGE",\ntxnId: "txn-789",\nacsTransId: "acs-456" }
deactivate GW

== Initiere Challenge 3DS2 ==

M -> TDS : POST /3ds/authenticate\n{ acsTransId: "acs-456", pan, amount }
activate TDS
TDS -> TDS : generate OTP = 6 cifre random\nexpiresAt = now + 5 minute
TDS -> PG : INSERT challenge_session\n{ acsTransId, otp, status:CHALLENGE_REQUIRED }
TDS --> M : { acsTransId: "acs-456",\nstatus: "CHALLENGE_REQUIRED",\nmessage: "Introduceti codul OTP" }
deactivate TDS

M -> CH : Afiseaza input OTP\n"Codul a fost trimis pe telefonul dvs."

note over CH : In productie: OTP trimis via SMS\nIn demo: GET /3ds/challenge/{id} expune OTP

== Verificare OTP ==

CH -> M : Introduce OTP: "482951"
M -> TDS : POST /3ds/challenge/acs-456\n{ otp: "482951" }
activate TDS
TDS -> PG : SELECT challenge WHERE acsTransId=?\nCHECK otp match + not expired
activate PG
PG --> TDS : { otp:"482951", expiresAt: valid }
deactivate PG

alt OTP corect + neexpirat
  TDS -> PG : UPDATE status = AUTHENTICATED
  TDS --> M : { status: "AUTHENTICATED",\nacsTransId: "acs-456" }
  note right : CAVV generat\n(Cardholder Auth Verification Value)
  deactivate TDS

  == Continuare autorizare ==

  M -> GW : POST /v1/payments/{txnId}/resume\n{ acsTransId: "acs-456" }
  activate GW
  GW -> NET : authorize (dupa 3DS confirmat)
  activate NET
  NET -> ISS : authorize
  ISS --> NET : { "00", authCode }
  NET --> GW : approved
  deactivate NET
  GW --> M : { status: "AUTHORIZED", authCode: "F3A291" }
  deactivate GW

else OTP gresit (max 3 incercari)
  TDS --> M : { status: "FAILED",\nmessage: "OTP incorect" }
  note right : Dupa 3 incercari:\nstatus = BLOCKED

else OTP expirat (> 5 minute)
  TDS --> M : { status: "EXPIRED",\nmessage: "Sesiune expirata" }
end

@enduml
